.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_GENERAL_NAMES_PRINT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_GENERAL_NAMES_print
.Nd print GeneralNames in a human-friendly, multi-line string
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509v3.h
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_GENERAL_NAMES_print
.Fa "BIO *out"
.Fa "GENERAL_NAMES *gens"
.Fa "int indent"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn OSSL_GENERAL_NAMES_print
prints a human readable version of the GeneralNames
.Fa gens
to BIO
.Fa out .
Each line is indented by
.Fa indent
spaces.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn OSSL_GENERAL_NAMES_print
always returns 1.
.Sh HISTORY
The functions described here were all added in OpenSSL 3.4.
